---
title: Privacy Policy - TerraPDF
description: How the TerraPDF website handles data. No accounts, no cookies set by us, cookieless analytics, and full disclosure of third-party resources.
layout: base.njk
permalink: /privacy/
---

<div class="container">
  <div class="section-header">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Effective date: July 15, 2026</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-section">
    <h2>Summary</h2>
    <p>
      terrapdf.com is a static informational website for the open-source TerraPDF library.
      There are no user accounts, no forms, and no sign-ups. We do not sell or share personal
      data, and this site does not set any cookies.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-section">
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We use Google Analytics 4 to understand aggregate site traffic (page views, referrers,
      approximate region). It runs in <strong>cookieless Consent Mode</strong>: all storage
      categories (<code>analytics_storage</code>, <code>ad_storage</code>, <code>ad_user_data</code>,
      <code>ad_personalization</code>) are denied by default, so <strong>no analytics or advertising
      cookies are set</strong> and no advertising features are enabled. Google receives anonymized,
      aggregated ping data and processes it on our behalf; see the
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a>.
      You can additionally block analytics entirely with any content blocker or the
      <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-section">
    <h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
    <p>
      This site is hosted on GitHub Pages. Like any web host, GitHub may log IP addresses of
      visitors for security and operational purposes. See the
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub Privacy Statement</a>.
      We do not have access to, and do not keep, our own server logs.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-section">
    <h2>Third-party resources</h2>
    <p>
      Fonts and scripts are self-hosted on terrapdf.com — your browser does not contact font or
      script CDNs to render this site. The only third-party asset requests are:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> (googletagmanager.com, google-analytics.com) — the cookieless analytics described above</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Each provider receives your IP address and browser user agent as part of the normal HTTP request. None of these requests are used by us to identify or track you.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-section">
    <h2>The TerraPDF library</h2>
    <p>
      The TerraPDF NuGet package itself contains <strong>no telemetry</strong>. It makes no network
      calls, collects no data, and phones home to nothing. This policy covers only this website.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-section">
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      For any privacy question or request, reach out via
      <a href="{{ site.discussions }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub Discussions</a>.
      Material changes to this policy will be noted on this page with an updated effective date.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
